        "content": [
          "the first step is",
          "identify the business need",
          "gather the business requirements",
          "create the RFP",
          "submitted to vendors",
          "The proposals received from the vendors should then be scored.",
          "a response should be requested from the vendors by a set date",
          "Based on the scored proposals, vendors should be downselected to present their proposals.",
          "Once the proposals have been received",
          "they should be scored again",
          "presentations should be attended",
          "the proposals should be rescored based on the Q&A sessions at the presentations",
          "If necessary",
          "pricing and scope adjustments should be requested",
          "The updated proposals should then be reviewed and rescored based on the final proposals.",
          "the vendors should be notified of the selection",
          "A contract should be created based on the winning proposal",
          "and this marks the end of the process."
        ]
      },
